{
  "uid": "priceradar-deadlocks",
  "title": "PriceRadar • INSERT deadlocks",
  "description": "Compare overlapping unordered imports, bounded whole-transaction retries, and consistent insertion order. See docs/experiments.md for the complete procedure.",
  "links": [
    {"title": "PriceRadar dashboards", "type": "dashboards", "tags": ["PriceRadar"], "asDropdown": true, "includeVars": false, "keepTime": true},
    {"title": "Prometheus targets", "type": "link", "url": "http://localhost:9090/targets", "targetBlank": true}
  ],
  "tags": [
    "PriceRadar"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-15m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "title": "Run this experiment",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 32, "w": 24, "h": 7},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 1. Reproduce\nRun `make up`, `make stop-load`, `make reset-imports`, then `make demo-deadlock`. Inspect the response and `make logs`: one transaction is aborted with 40P01.\n\n### 2. Compare\nRun `make load-deadlock MODE=unordered DURATION=60 RETRY=false`, repeat with `RETRY=true`, then use `MODE=ordered RETRY=false`. Keep WORKERS, BATCH_SIZE, and OVERLAP identical. Compare deadlocks, attempts/retries, successful batches, committed rows, and batch p95 over each run's own time range. No source edit is required.\n\n### 3. Finish\nRun `make stop-load` and `make reset-imports` (deletes reserved import data only). Load deadlocks are probabilistic; the demo is deterministic. Five-second samples can miss short waits. Full commands and caveats: `docs/experiments.md`."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Deadlocks / second",
      "description": "Application counter records caught 40P01 errors. Database counter covers all sessions in this database. Do not add these together.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "spanNulls": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (mode) (rate(priceradar_import_deadlocks_total[30s]))",
          "legendFormat": "application {{mode}}",
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        },
        {
          "expr": "rate(priceradar_db_database_deadlocks_total[30s])",
          "legendFormat": "database-wide",
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
